graph TB
    A[Start Application] --> B{File Selected?}
    B -->|No| C[Show File Selection Dialog]
    B -->|Yes| D[Parse Mermaid Code]
    
    C --> E[User Selects File]
    E --> F[Read File Content]
    F --> D
    
    D --> G{Valid Mermaid?}
    G -->|No| H[Show Error Message]
    G -->|Yes| I[Render SVG Diagram]
    
    H --> C
    I --> J[Display in Viewport]
    
    J --> K[Auto-collapse Controls]
    K --> L[Enable File Watching]
    L --> M[Enable Zoom & Pan]
    
    M --> N{User Interaction?}
    N -->|Zoom| O[Calculate Zoom Position]
    N -->|Pan| P[Update Pan Coordinates]
    N -->|File Change| Q[Reload & Re-render]
    N -->|New File| C
    
    O --> R[Update Transform Matrix]
    P --> R
    Q --> D
    
    R --> S[Apply CSS Transform]
    S --> T[Update Zoom Info Display]
    T --> N
    
    style A fill:#e1f5fe
    style I fill:#c8e6c9
    style M fill:#fff3e0
    style R fill:#f3e5f5
    style S fill:#e8f5e8